!! :hover

https://www.w3schools.com/csSref/sel_hover.asp

the w3c uses a:hover for a lot of the examples — but you can do a :hover state on anything! — this is for "rollover" states.

!! :active

https://www.w3schools.com/cssref/sel_active.asp

the w3c uses a:hover for a lot of the examples — but you can do a :active state on anything! — this is equivalent to "click".

